{{- /*
orderfilters.tmpl is the row across the top of a list of orders.

Each link keeps half of what is showing and changes the other, so pressing
"Oldest first" does not also reset which orders are being shown. The two
halves are built in contexts.go, where the current view is.

Called with the list's own context.
*/ -}}
--nav[pills]--
{{- range .Filters}}
[{{.Label}}]({{.Link}}){{if .On}}[active=on]{{end}}
{{- end}}
--right--
{{- range .Orderings}}
[{{.Label}}]({{.Link}}){{if .On}}[active=on]{{end}}
{{- end}}
--/nav--
